# Shared scans/cache/atomic quotas. Configure one complete pair in every
# Vercel environment that should offer the free check; missing config returns 503.
# Both the scan and inquiry functions must use the same Redis database/env.
# No service is purchased/provisioned by the application.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# Alternatively use the existing Vercel KV-compatible REST credentials:
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

